{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-b67416f482", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "去年我在另一个城市迷路，一位老人把我送到了车站。", "en": "Last year, I got lost in another city and an old man took me to the station.", "sub": "在另一个城市迷路，老人送到车站", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:11+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-fa3e10b65d", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "去年旅行时我在一个陌生的城市迷路，幸好一位老人带我到车站。", "en": "Last year, when I was traveling in a strange city, I got lost, but a kind old man brought me to the station.", "sub": "在另一个城市迷路，老人送到车站", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:11+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-80360564a5", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "上次在机场我差点误机，还好工作人员帮我改了票。", "en": "Last time at the airport, I almost missed my flight, but the staff helped me change my ticket.", "sub": "赶飞机迟到，工作人员帮忙改签", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:11+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-5cf88cf611", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "上次旅行时下雨我没带伞，一家店的店主借给我一把。", "en": "Last time on a trip, it rained and I didn't have an umbrella, but the shop owner lent me one.", "sub": "下雨没带伞，店主借伞", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:11+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-d496e9503f", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "前年出去玩遇到下雨，我没带伞，店主借了我一把。", "en": "The year before last, when it rained while I was out, I didn't have an umbrella, but the shop owner lent me one.", "sub": "下雨没带伞，店主借伞", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:11+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-292203c457", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "去年旅行时我把钱包丢了，警察帮我找了回来。", "en": "Last year, while traveling, I lost my wallet, and the police helped me get it back.", "sub": "钱包丢了，警察帮忙找回", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:23+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-145e6925e4", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "有一次我在外地丢了钱包，后来警察帮我找到了。", "en": "Once, while traveling, I lost my wallet, and the police helped me find it.", "sub": "钱包丢了，警察帮忙找回", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:23+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-63d944dd03", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "去年住酒店时空调坏了，前台帮我换了一个房间。", "en": "Last year, the air conditioning broke when I was staying at a hotel, so the front desk gave me a different room.", "sub": "酒店房间有问题，前台换了房", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:23+00:00"}
