{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-651c55e0ef", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "去年我赶飞机迟到了，结果工作人员帮我改签了下一班。", "en": "Last year, I was late for my flight, so the staff helped me change to the next one.", "sub": "赶飞机迟到，工作人员帮忙改签", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:35+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-5fa6b84462", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "unexpected", "micro_zh": "意外", "zh": "上次坐飞机行李被拿错了，结果机场帮我找了回来。", "en": "Last time, my luggage was mixed up at the airport, but they found it for me.", "sub": "行李被拿错，机场帮忙找到", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:50+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-6f3917ac7a", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "unexpected", "micro_zh": "意外", "zh": "去年旅行时行李被别人拿错，还好机场很快找到了。", "en": "Last year, my luggage was taken by mistake while traveling, but the airport found it quickly.", "sub": "行李被拿错，机场帮忙找到", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:52+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-23f942f853", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "unexpected", "micro_zh": "意外", "zh": "去年在国外吃饭时不会说当地话，所以只能用手势点菜。", "en": "Last year, I couldn't speak the local language while eating abroad, so I used gestures to order.", "sub": "语言不通，用手势点餐", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:53+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-40c1c80587", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "unexpected", "micro_zh": "意外", "zh": "上次出国旅行语言不通，我用手势点了一顿饭。", "en": "Last time traveling abroad, I couldn't speak the language, so I used gestures to order food.", "sub": "语言不通，用手势点餐", "angle": "past simple / past continuous + a connector", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:26:56+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-ca2e59dbbf", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "journey", "micro_zh": "旅途", "zh": "上次住酒店时房间有问题，所以前台给我换了一间。", "en": "Last time, the hotel room had a problem, so the front desk gave me another one.", "sub": "酒店房间有问题，前台换了房", "angle": "past tense + a connector such as when, while, so, but, then", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:35:46+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_travel_story-35e8e6937d", "scene": "narrative_travel_story", "scene_zh": "叙事·旅行故事", "scene_en": "Narrative: Travel Story", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "unexpected", "micro_zh": "意外", "zh": "上次爬山时我手机没电了，只好向路人求助。", "en": "Last time, my phone died while climbing, so I asked a stranger for help.", "sub": "在山上手机没电，向路人求助", "angle": "past tense + a connector such as when, while, so, but, then", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_travel_story", "topic": "travel_story", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_travel_story", "topic::travel_story"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:35:50+00:00"}
